Q-LACE
Study authors: Jin Kim, Fereidoun Abtin, Matthew S. Brown, and Dan Ruan.

This software includes source derived from Visual-RFT:
https://github.com/Liuziyu77/Visual-RFT
The upstream Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.

Q-LACE adds longitudinal dataset construction, adaptation/evaluation utilities,
conditional-reliability analyses, synthetic tests, and aggregate-result exports.
Public-repository adaptations are described in PORTABILITY.md and the file
manifest. Existing source notices remain applicable.

This notice does not grant access to or redistribution rights for any source
medical dataset, pretrained model, or trained adapter.
